# Git workflow

- Do not create pull requests, merge requests, draft PRs, or PR feature branches.
- Commit finished work directly on `main`.
- Push to `origin/main` only when the repository is public (`git push origin main`).
- Do not push non-public (private/internal) repositories — leave commits local on `main`.
- Do not use `gh pr create`, ManagePullRequest create/update flows, or other PR-creation tooling.
- Prefer updating `AGENTS.md` / `.cursor/rules` when workflow policy changes; keep this rule in sync.
